# [PHALA-BUILD-CONTEXT-PRIVACY 2026-10-06 by Codex]
# [PHALA-BUILD-CONTEXT-ALLOWLIST 2026-10-08 by Codex] Unknown root files,
# operator records and private worktrees must not reach a remote builder.
# Keep literal prefixes: parent-directory exceptions would admit siblings.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/aeronyx-blind-issuer/Cargo.toml
!crates/aeronyx-blind-issuer/src/**
!crates/aeronyx-core/Cargo.toml
!crates/aeronyx-core/src/**
!crates/aeronyx-transport/Cargo.toml
!crates/aeronyx-transport/src/**
!crates/aeronyx-server/Cargo.toml
!crates/aeronyx-server/src/**
!crates/aeronyx-common/Cargo.toml
!crates/aeronyx-common/src/**
!deploy/node/server.phala.peer.example.toml
# [PHALA-COPY-CONTEXT-CONTRACT 2026-10-08 by Codex] isolated-vpn has a
# separate literal COPY; do not admit the surrounding operator directory.
!deploy/node/server.phala.example.toml

# Defense in depth inside the admitted public Rust source trees. Dockerfile
# and .dockerignore remain builder control inputs, not runtime COPY inputs.
.git
**/.git
.dart_tool
.build
build
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.codex-cache
**/.codex-target
**/.codex-tmp
*.log
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# This image builds only the Rust workspace; do not send private client trees.
android
assets
ios
lib
macos
windows
linux
web
test
integration_test

# Local identities, databases, and generated operator state are never image inputs.
**/server_key.json
**/node_info.json
**/.aeronyx-identity-*.pending
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/secrets
